# (a) A turn ends, 20 idle minutes pass, the timer fires, context is big, so the mod compacts.
title:   Twenty quiet minutes, then a compact
caption: When a turn ends, the mod arms a 20-minute timer. Nobody comes back, the timer fires, the context is still at least 120k tokens, so the conversation is compacted before the prompt cache goes cold.
note:    1 column = 1 minute; the ≈ break skips ten quiet minutes. idleSeconds (1200) and minTokens (120000) are live-tunable.
focus:   C
break:   +10 min

time        0    5m ≈   20m
claude   -S~E-------≈--------
timer       [=======≈===F
compact  -----------≈----C---

legend
S  turn.start      blue
~  turn            teal
E  turn.complete — arms the timer  teal
=  idle timer · 20 min  violet
F  timer fires — context ≥ 120k  violet
C  compact — fresh, small context  green
